Subject: [PATCH] fact_pack: show analyst-named flag columns; screen: warn when
 eps.csv exists but --eps-csv omitted

- fact_pack GROUPS now include capex_tag_hold, capex_unconfirmed, fail_dilution,
  revenue_subset_history_suspect, tangible_book_buyback_exempt,
  lease_heavy_upper_bound, currency_unresolved (flags) and dilution_sbc_issuance (shares).
- New test parses screening-analyst.md backticked tokens, intersects with the
  gate0.csv header, and asserts each is in GROUPS (plus an explicit list).
- screen.py prints a stderr WARNING when eps.csv sits in cwd or the data root
  and --eps-csv is not passed; --no-eps-ok silences it. Behaviour and exit code
  unchanged; shortlist CSVs byte-identical.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
